  :classification-doctrine
  "REPLACE when: (1) referring to the Motoi CORE-vs-MODULE tier system, or
   (2) describing add-on Motoi packages loadable via (import (motoi ...)), or
   (3) using 'Sakura/our extensions' where the referent is the domain-verb layer.
   SKIP when: (1) SLAT tagged-extensions (EDN-borrowed reader mechanism),
   (2) file extensions (.slat, .sks, .jpg, .otf),
   (3) R7RS/spec citations ('R7RS-small subset + extension'),
   (4) formal-math extensions (field, group, predicate),
   (5) physical/anatomical extensions (arm, table leaf, extension bar),
   (6) MD/VitePress/browser/Shopify/Ruby-C product extensions,
   (7) plugin-architecture 'extension points',
   (8) LOAM/Marionette Sakura-app-level cart or chapter extension mechanisms,
   (9) 'extension of X' (extending sense of the word),
   (10) Alfred's terminology-lock statements themselves (documenting the lock)."

